  "details": "Simply activating vrchat has a chance of this happening. It's random. But frequent. Eac attempts to scan things it's forbidden from doing such as ram sticks or bios chip. Resulting in blue screens. Making vrchat unplayable for lower end systems\n\nI should also mention I delete the .sys file before opening vrchat to ensure a fresh install of that eac file occurs to reduce the amount of potential blue screen errors.",
